ss=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids came in under 90% of normal in November to December 38 times in 75 years, more than any other pair of months. In 2025 that same pair ran 47% of normal on the middle, and August to September ran 61%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 19% and February to March at 39% on the middle. A preliminary estimate puts August to September 2026 at 37.5 on grid 19963.</p>"}
